_geom_special_details
;'Fractional coordinates and displacement parameters follow the tedhadleyite
 framework (Cooper and Hawthorne, Mineralogical Magazine 73 (2009) 227-234,
 DOI 10.1180/minmag.2009.073.2.227). The unit-cell metric was refined against
 pattern.csv. Br and Cl share one crystallographic site in equal occupancy to
 impose the supplied Hg11I2BrClO4 composition.'
